I walk to the bus stop.
It is morning time.
There are many people on the street.
A red BEST bus arrives.
The bus stops and I go inside.
There is a crowd in the bus today.
I hold the bus handrail securely.
The conductor comes near me.
He says, "Ticket, madam."
I say, "One ticket, bhaiya."
I give him twenty rupees.
He gives me the ticket.
I keep the ticket in my bag.
I look outside the window.
There are many vehicles on the road.
Some people drink tea at the shops.
Auto-rickshaws run fast.
The city of Mumbai is very busy.
My office is close now.
I like this morning commute.
